# Every artifact in this repo is hashed (JCS/SHA-256 ledger chain, CT entry hashes,
# canonical-text SHA-256s). A CRLF checkout on Windows would change the bytes that
# `git show` hands the append-only guards, so the whole tree is pinned to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing here is binary today, but keep the door closed rather than ajar.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
